# Code Correction Challenge

This repository contains a collection of coding problems where you are tasked with correcting buggy code snippets. Each problem is accompanied by a detailed description, including the expected input and output, as well as the programming language used.

## How to Contribute

1. Fork this repository to your own GitHub account.
2. Clone the forked repository to your local machine.
3. Create a new branch for your solution.
4. Solve the coding problem by correcting the buggy code snippet.
5. Ensure that your solution passes the provided test cases.
6. Commit your changes with a descriptive commit message.
7. Push your changes to your forked repository.
8. Create a pull request to merge your solution into the main repository.

