### Question
Write a function that takes an array of integers and returns the sum of all the even numbers in the array.

### Solution
```java
public class SumEvenNumbers {
    public static int sumEvenNumbers(int[] arr) {
        int sum = 0;
        for (int num : arr) {
            if (num % 2 == 0) {
                sum += num;
            }
        }
        return sum;
    }
}
```

