### Question
Write a function that takes a list of integers and returns the maximum sum of any contiguous subarray.

### Solution
```javascript
function maxSubarraySum(arr) {
    let maxSum = arr[0];
    let currentSum = arr[0];
    for (let i = 1; i < arr.length; i++) {
        currentSum = Math.max(arr[i], currentSum + arr[i]);
        maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, currentSum);
    }
    return maxSum;
}
```

## Example Question
Here's an example of a coding question and its solution:

### Question
Write a function that takes a string and returns the longest palindromic substring.

### Solution
```c++
#include <string>
#include <algorithm>

std::string longestPalindrome(std::string s) {
    int n = s.length();
    if (n == 0) return "";

    int start = 0, end = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        int len1 = expandAroundCenter(s, i, i);
        int len2 = expandAroundCenter(s, i, i + 1);
        int len = std::max(len1, len2);
        if (len > end - start) {
            start = i - (len - 1) / 2;
            end = i + len / 2;
        }
    }

    return s.substr(start, end - start + 1);
}

int expandAroundCenter(std::string s, int left, int right) {
    while (left >= 0 && right < s.length() && s[left] == s[right]) {
        left--;
        right++;
    }
    return right - left - 1;
}
```

