```java
public class UniqueCharacters {
    public static int countUniqueCharacters(String str) {
        Set<Character> uniqueChars = new HashSet<>();
        for (char c : str.toCharArray()) {
            uniqueChars.add(c);
        }
        return uniqueChars.size();
    }
}
```

