- [Challenges](#challenges)
- [Contributing](#contributing)
- [License](#license)

## Getting Started

To get started with the challenges, follow these steps:

1. Clone this repository to your local machine using the following command:
   ```
   git clone https://github.com/your-username/java-coding-challenge.git
   ```

2. Navigate to the `challenges` directory:
   ```
   cd java-coding-challenge/challenges
   ```

3. Choose a challenge you want to work on and open the corresponding Java file in your preferred IDE or text editor.

4. Read the challenge description and test cases carefully.

5. Implement the solution in the provided Java file.

6. Test your solution against the provided test cases to ensure it works correctly.

7. Once you have completed the challenge, submit your solution by creating a pull request.

