# Codeforces
This repository contains my solutions to various problems on Codeforces. Each problem is organized in a separate directory, and the solution is provided in the form of a Java file.

## Problem 1244F: [F. The Number of Ways to Paint a Fence](https://codeforces.com/problemset/problem/1244/F)
### Solution
```java
import java.io.*;
import java.util.*;

public class F {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        BufferedReader bf = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));
        PrintWriter out = new PrintWriter(new BufferedWriter(new OutputStreamWriter(System.out)));
        StringTokenizer st = new StringTokenizer(bf.readLine());
        int n = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());
        int k = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());
        String s = bf.readLine();
        int[] dp = new int[n + 1];
        dp[0] = 1;
        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
            if (s.charAt(i - 1) == 'B') {
                dp[i] = dp[i - 1];
            } else {
                dp[i] = (dp[i - 1] + dp[i - 2]) % 1000000007;
            }
        }
        out.println(dp[n]);
        out.close();
    }
}
```

