This repository contains solutions to various coding problems. The solutions are provided in different programming languages, including C++, Java, Python, and JavaScript.

## Table of Contents
- [Introduction](#introduction)
- [Contributing](#contributing)
- [License](#license)

## Introduction
This repository serves as a collection of coding problem solutions. Each solution is organized into a separate directory, and the directory name corresponds to the problem number or title. Within each directory, you will find the solution code in the specified programming language.

## Contributing
Contributions to this repository are welcome! If you have a solution to a coding problem that you would like to share, please follow these steps:

1. Fork the repository.
2. Create a new branch for your solution.
3. Add your solution code to the appropriate directory.
4. Commit your changes and push them to your fork.
5. Create a pull request to merge your solution into the main repository.

Please ensure that your solution adheres to the coding style and conventions of the repository. If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to open an issue.

