## Introduction
This repository serves as a resource for developers and learners who are looking for solutions to coding problems. The solutions are organized by programming language and problem category. Each solution includes a clear explanation of the approach used, along with code snippets and test cases.

## Getting Started
To get started with the solutions in this repository, follow these steps:

1. Clone the repository to your local machine using the following command:
